      "@type": "OverallIntent",
      "instance_name": "overallintent_instance",
      "label": "the overallintent",
      "description": "meme-id: loading_the_dishwasher_in_the_back; hasOverallIntent: overall-intent_id; overall-intent-description: The image depicts a moving truck with a person loading items, including a dishwasher, into the back of the truck. The text overlay reads 'loading the dishwasher in the back' and 'solid move'. The overall intent of the meme is to humorously suggest that the person is making a 'solid move' by loading the dishwasher into the back of the truck, implying that this is a smart or well-thought-out decision. There is no toxicity present in the image or text, as it does not contain any disparaging metaphors, stereotypes, or harmful content. The meme is purely comedic and does not target any specific group or individual based on protected characteristics.",
